        "id": 14831,
        "title": "Funzioni",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130927,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Proprio come in JavaScript, definiamo una funzione in TypeScript usando la parola chiave <code>function</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, world&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"func\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, world\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 131039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una differenza è che possiamo e dobbiamo definire il tipo restituito dalla funzione. Usiamo <code>void</code> per indicare che non viene restituito alcun valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"void\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, world&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(); \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, world\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>void</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando usi i parametri in TypeScript, devi specificare anche il tipo degli argomenti che usi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"void\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Peter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Peter\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name</code>, seguito da <code>:</code> e infine <code>string</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130929,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri multipli funzionano come previsto: li separiamo con virgole e aggiungiamo il tipo dopo i due punti per ogni argomento.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\", b: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"void\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sum = a + b;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;The sum is: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + sum);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sum(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"b\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The sum is: 15\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>a</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e infine <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy",
            "id": 131041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se restituiamo qualcosa, lo definiamo specificando il tipo restituito. In questo caso, vogliamo impostarlo su <code>number</code> perché restituiamo un numero.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\", b: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sum = a + b;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sum;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = sum(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"15\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>number</code>, seguito da <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se vogliamo passare un array, dobbiamo indicare che specificare un array di un certo tipo è il tipo del nostro parametro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sumArray\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"numbers: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numbers.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"sum, num\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" sum + num, \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sumArray([\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"15\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>number</code>, seguito da <code>[</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il tipo restituito corretto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"logMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"void\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"logMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I love coding!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"I love coding!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>void</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 131045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il tipo restituito dalla funzione <code>celsiusToFahrenheit</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"celsiusToFahrenheit\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"celsius: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (celsius * \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") + \" /><text value=\"32\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(celsiusToFahrenheit(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"77\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>number</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>string</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>void</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130932,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi i tipi corretti per far funzionare la funzione come previsto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"countCharacters\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"str: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" str.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(countCharacters(\" /><text value=\"&quot;TypeScript&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"void\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>string</code>, seguito da <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 131043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il tipo restituito da una funzione che non restituisce alcun valore in TypeScript?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>void</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>void</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
